;\n            }\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            pushFlow();\n        }\n        System.out.println(totalCost);\n    }\n\n    static void solve() {}\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < MAXN; i++) {\n            graph[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n        }\n        input();\n        solve();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0003319427778478712, -3.814689989667386e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -0.000802075956016779, -2.276871418871451e-05, -0.20144023001194, -0.2520061433315277, -1.3351351299206726e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.924526340095326e-05, -0.1602260321378708, -0.0006637753685936332, -0.012566902674734592, -0.14129067957401276, -0.007642199285328388, -0.0017500099493190646, -9.536738616588991e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.31330278515815735, -1.823885577323381e-05, -3.480850500636734e-05, -0.5760372877120972, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -7.033323527139146e-06, -1.6093124941107817e-05, -0.00012003655137959868, -0.012517930008471012, -0.030236994847655296, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.622600959512056e-06, 0.0, -0.0004306104383431375, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1444026313256472e-05, 0.0, -2.622600959512056e-06, -2.622600959512056e-06, -4.172316494077677e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.1426762193441391, -0.6326159834861755, -2.706014311115723e-05, -0.0070679159834980965, -0.00411295285448432, -0.00040737437666393816, -5.006777428206988e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -7.867782187531702e-06, -5.125986263010418e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.34844541549682617, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -6.592056161025539e-05, -0.017412999644875526, -3.0874729418428615e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, -7.986990567587782e-06, -3.57